# Example crontab entry for the weekly Hansard update.
# Install with `crontab -e` (or `crontab scripts/crontab.example` to replace).
#
# Runs every Sunday at 13:00 server time. The wrapper handles venv, locking,
# logging, and .env loading; secrets live in .env, never here.
#
# Note: cron has a minimal environment and no SSH agent, so the GitHub push needs
# either a stored git credential (HTTPS GIT_PUSH_URL) or a passphraseless deploy
# key referenced via GIT_SSH_COMMAND in .env. See docs/publishing.md.

0 13 * * 0 /home/sr/a2aj-hansard/scripts/weekly_update.sh
